Description: Native stereo presentation of an explicitly selected X11 image drawable
 Copy the native left-first side by side drawable into one declared image window
 without resampling. Stereo KWin presents each eye and leaves the application's
 original controls in ordinary 2D. Requires the edition's declaration version 6.
